      "name": "ping",
      "description": "Report the server's BACnet/IP settings and state; sends nothing.\n\nShows the bound interface and port, the broadcast address (if any),\nthe server's own device instance, whether writes are enabled, the\ndevices whose addresses are known, and the object map status.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {},
